// D4721's list without its record: a list literal of an inline record and `null`, whose
// un-annotated face infers the element as a nullable inline record that no declared type names.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@VALUE@@
[{ x: 1 }, null]
// @@TYPE@@
({ x: i32 } | null)[]
